}
```

3. Implement this interface in your `Startup.cs` file inside the `ConfigureServices()` method. In this implementation, we'll use the `SymmetricSecurityKey` class to verify the signature of the token and extract its payload. The `SigningCredentials` object is used to specify the key and algorithm used to sign the token.

```csharp
services.AddSingleton<IJwtAuthenticationManager>(jwtManager =>
