WebRTC (Web Real-Time Communication) is a JavaScript API that enables real-time communication, including video and audio streaming, between browsers and devices. Here's how to use it to open/close the camera and microphone:

Open Camera:

```javascript
const localStream = await navigator.mediaDevices.getUserMedia({ video: true });
