audioElement.srcObject = localStream;
```

Close Microphone:

```javascript
if (localStream && localStream.getAudioTracks().length > 0) {
  localStream.getAudioTracks()[0].stop();
}
```

2. Using MediaDevices:

The `MediaDevices` interface provides access to devices used for capturing media, such as cameras and microphones. Here's how to use it to open/close the camera and microphone:

Open Camera:

```javascript
const videoStream = await navigator.mediaDevices.getUserMedia({ video: true });
videoElement.srcObject = videoStream;
```

Close Camera:

```javascript
if (videoStream) {
  videoStream.getTracks().forEach(track => track.stop());
}
```

Open Microphone:

```javascript
const audioStream = await navigator.mediaDevices.getUserMedia({ audio: true });
audioElement.srcObject = audioStream;
```

Close Microphone:

```javascript
if (audioStream) {
  audioStream.getTracks().forEach(track => track.stop());
}
```

